  "content": "\n\n<p>英文：</p>\n<p><strong><span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">B</span>TaCZ Durability</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>为现代 NeoForge 时代的 TACZ 带来武器耐久、卡壳与维修机制。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>功能介绍：</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>为所有 TACZ 武器添加&nbsp;</span><strong><span>耐久度</span></strong><span>&nbsp;（可按枪械或分类单独配置）</span></li>\n<li><span>随着耐久度下降，武器&nbsp;</span><strong><span>卡壳</span></strong><span>&nbsp;频率会更高</span></li>\n<li><span>检视武器时显示直观的&nbsp;</span><strong><span>耐久度指示器</span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>维修系统</span></strong><span>，配备维修材料与武器维修台</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span>原项目 -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-durability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-durability</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>💬 加入 Discord 服务器以获取更新、反馈与建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>俄文：<br></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">B</span>TaCZ Durability</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>为现代 NeoForge 上的 TACZ 添加武器耐久、卡壳及维修系统。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>新增内容：</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span>耐久度</span></strong><span>&nbsp;适用于所有 TACZ 武器（支持按枪管或类别单独配置）</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>卡壳机制</span></strong><span>&nbsp;，耐久度越低，卡壳概率越高</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>耐久度指示器</span></strong><span>&nbsp;在检视武器时显示</span></li>\n<li><strong><span>维修系统</span></strong><span>&nbsp;配备消耗品与维修台</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span>原项目 -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-durability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-durability</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>💬 加入我们的 Discord 服务器或 Telegram 频道，以关注更新、报告问题并提出建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>",
